# Key Vault secret names read at deploy time, one per line.
# Letters, digits and dashes only. Dashes become underscores in the container
# environment (PLUGGY-CLIENT-ID becomes PLUGGY_CLIENT_ID).
GMF-SMOKE-TEST
PLUGGY-CLIENT-ID
PLUGGY-CLIENT-SECRET
PLUGGY-ITEMS
AUTH-PASSWORD-HASH
AUTH-TOTP-SECRET
AUTH-RECOVERY-HASHES
OPENROUTER-API-KEY
# A trailing ? marks a secret that may not exist yet. With it, GitHub can tell the app a new image is out.
DEPLOY-WEBHOOK-SECRET?
